# Anima-Turbo v1.0 批量生成 Prompt
# 20 张图，每张图只需要复制 positive 字段

## 全局参数
- Steps: 8-12
- CFG: 1
- Sampler: euler
- Scheduler: simple
- Resolution: 832x1216 → 重采样到 768x1024

## 通用 Positive 前缀
masterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, 

## 通用 Negative
worst quality, low quality, score_1, score_2, score_3, bad_anatomy, bad_hands, text, error, missing_fingers, extra_digit, fewer_digits, cropped, jpeg_artifacts, signature, watermark, username, blurry, 3d, realistic, deformed, extra_limbs, mutated, poorly_drawn_hands, poorly_drawn_face, mutation, extra_fingers, bad_proportions, disfigured, malformed, missing_arms, missing_legs, fused_fingers, long_neck

